		(uuid "843e59ec-7b86-4ce7-8f75-9e01ea5c114a")
	)
	(text "DESCRIPTION\n\n12v permanent live from vehicle\n12v permanent live after reverse polarity protection\n12v permanent live after the voltage reading circuitry\n12v switched power from the relay (either permanent live or ignition)\n12v ignition signal (high when ignition on)\n12v ignition signal after reverse polarity protection\nVehicle chassis ground\nSystem ground\n3.3V supply from the MCU\n3.3V auxillary rail, on when AUX_SW is high\n5v power rail, supplies the MCU\n5v auxillary rail, on when AUX_SW is high\n\n\n\nStatus LED control pin\nIgnition sense signal (HIGH if ignition on)\nReset signal (pulse to reset board)\n\n\n\nAuxillary power control, enables 3.3v and 5v aux rails when high\nAlert interrupt (INA228)\nRelay SET (always on), pulse 3.3v for 350ms\nRelay RST (ignition on), pulse 3.3v for 350ms\nHIGH when always-on, RLY_RST_FB will be LOW\nLOW when ignition-on, RLY_SET_FB will be HIGH\n\n\n\nI2C channel SDA (INA228/accelerometer)\nI2C channel SCL (INA228/accelerometer)\nAccellerometer interrupt 1\nAccellerometer interrupt 2\nCAN CS pin\nCAN SDO pin\nCAN SDI pin\nCAN SCK pin\nCAN INT pin\nK-line RX pin (ISO-9141)\nK-line TX pin (ISO-9141)\nL-line send pin (ISO-9141)\nL-line recv pin (ISO-9141)\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V\nGeneral-purpose GPIO 0-36V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 201.676 68.326 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "KiCad Font")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "87b15abc-c57d-48f4-bb23-fb6d1845be27")
	)
